          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.2. Why are 1, 3, 6, 10, 15, … called triangular numbers? Why are 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, … called square numbers or squares? Why are 1, 8, 27, 64, 125, … called cubes? Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
